<%# Shown once, to a signed-out visitor without the `welcomed` cookie (see show_welcome? in
    ApplicationHelper). The controller sets that cookie the moment the modal opens rather
    than when it is closed: a visitor who takes one of the buttons, or just clicks away,
    has still been welcomed, and should not be asked again on the next page.

    The adblock line is drawn hidden and only shown for a browser that can take one of
    the three links below. Which browser it is can only be told in the page -- Brave
    says so through navigator.brave, not in its user agent -- so the choice is the
    controller's, and the links stay here with the rest of the copy. %>
<div class="modal fade welcome-modal"
     id="welcomeModal"
     tabindex="-1"
     aria-labelledby="welcomeModalLabel"
     aria-hidden="true"
     data-turbo-temporary
     data-controller="welcome"
     data-welcome-chrome-url-value="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/ublock-origin-lite/ddkjiahejlhfcafbddmgiahcphecmpfh"
     data-welcome-firefox-url-value="https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/ublock-origin/"
     data-welcome-safari-url-value="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ublock-origin-lite/id6745342698">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
        <h5 class="modal-title" id="welcomeModalLabel">Welcome to <%= site_name %></h5>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong><%= site_name %></strong>, a place to curate, share, and surf your
          very own TV channels, full of the shows and films you love. The controller is in
          your hands!
        </p>
        <p class="welcome-modal__adblock" data-welcome-target="adblock" hidden>
          Some of the media sources we use are from 3rd parties who inject ads we have no
          control over. Nothing dangerous, but for the most seamless ad-free experience it is
          highly recommended you
          <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-welcome-target="adblockLink">install an adblocker</a>,
          or switch to <a href="https://brave.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Brave browser</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <%= link_to 'Watch Now', cable_path, class: 'btn btn-success' %>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary" data-action="welcome#search">Search</button>
        <%# The tour is not built yet. The button is here so the footer is laid out for it. %>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Take Tour</button>
        <%= link_to 'Sign Up', new_user_registration_path, class: 'btn btn-primary' %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
